# …but the small, web-optimized hero clip(s) must ship with the site.
# Glob covers versioned names (hero-v2.mp4, hero-v3.mp4, …) — bump the version
# in the filename whenever the clip changes so caches can't serve a stale one.
!website/assets/hero*.mp4

# Bundled pose models (binary, fetched via scripts/fetch_pose_model.sh)
app/assets/models/*.task

